WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.667
-Our first guest
is a multi-platinum

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:04.200
Grammy-winning music superstar.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.367
You can see her as a coach
on "The Voice"

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:09.968
every Monday and Tuesday
at 8:00 p.m. on NBC.

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:12.868
Please welcome Ariana Grande!

00:00:12.868 --> 00:00:14.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.667 --> 00:00:17.601
Yeah! Ha ha ha! Ahh!

00:00:17.601 --> 00:00:20.033
Mwah! Mwah! I love you.

00:00:20.033 --> 00:00:21.801
-I love you so much.

00:00:21.801 --> 00:00:23.167
I miss you. I miss New York.

00:00:23.167 --> 00:00:24.934
I miss your face,
even though I just saw you.

00:00:24.934 --> 00:00:27.334
-Yeah. We just saw each other.
You did me a favor.

00:00:27.334 --> 00:00:29.033
You were on my show,
"That's My Jam,"

00:00:29.033 --> 00:00:31.267
which is going to air
after "The Voice."

00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:32.400
Yeah, it's really fun.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.567
It's, like, little
music mini games.

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:37.234
-It is very fun. I felt like
I was on another planet.

00:00:37.234 --> 00:00:40.133
-[ Laughs ]
You'll see it.

00:00:40.133 --> 00:00:42.434
But, it's -- Yeah,
you were fantastic in it.

00:00:42.434 --> 00:00:46.601
But 'cause you also just --
'Cause you know how to act, too.

00:00:46.601 --> 00:00:48.000
You'll see it. It's funny.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.434
But speaking of acting,
you're in a new movie

00:00:51.434 --> 00:00:54.133
coming out next month
called "Don't Look Up."

00:00:54.133 --> 00:00:55.200
-Yes.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:56.467
-This is directed by Adam McKay.

00:00:56.467 --> 00:00:59.100
I love Adam McKay.
It is a huge cast.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:02.767
Meryl Streep, Jennifer Lawrence,
Leonardo DiCaprio,

00:01:02.767 --> 00:01:05.734
Tyler Perry, Timothée Chalamet,
Ariana Grande.

00:01:05.734 --> 00:01:07.000
Come on!

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:09.133 --> 00:01:11.968
Right there.
How do you --

00:01:11.968 --> 00:01:13.434
-Oh. There it is.

00:01:13.434 --> 00:01:15.367
-There it is, right there.

00:01:15.367 --> 00:01:18.267
How do you --
How did you get the part?

00:01:18.267 --> 00:01:20.067
Did you talk to McKay or did...?

00:01:20.067 --> 00:01:22.100
-So this was --

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:25.434
it was so exciting because
I -- I love Adam McKay.

00:01:25.434 --> 00:01:26.767
I'm such a fan of his work.

00:01:26.767 --> 00:01:30.267
I'm such a comedy fan.
And I adore him.

00:01:30.267 --> 00:01:31.968
And he reached out,
and he said, you know,

00:01:31.968 --> 00:01:34.267
"I have this role for you
in my new movie."

00:01:34.267 --> 00:01:36.501
And I was like,
"Oh, my God. Well, hold on

00:01:36.501 --> 00:01:38.267
because I have to audition.
I need to earn this.

00:01:38.267 --> 00:01:41.334
I need to put myself on tape.
When can I come in for it?"

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:43.567
And he was like, "No, no, no.
It's not -- It's a tiny thing.

00:01:43.567 --> 00:01:45.033
It's a tiny, quick thing."

00:01:45.033 --> 00:01:47.334
I was like, "Okay, okay.
Let me read it.

00:01:47.334 --> 00:01:49.834
I want to make sure
I can do this."

00:01:49.834 --> 00:01:52.234
And, so, I just -- I read it.

00:01:52.234 --> 00:01:53.534
I loved it. It's brilliant.

00:01:53.534 --> 00:01:57.467
I have this tiny but such
a fun and incredible part.

00:01:57.467 --> 00:01:59.501
I feel so excited that
I got to be a part of this.

00:01:59.501 --> 00:02:02.234
It was so cool.
-Who do you play?

00:02:02.234 --> 00:02:05.534
-I play Riley Bina,
who is this aloof

00:02:05.534 --> 00:02:08.467
and somewhat unaware pop star

00:02:08.467 --> 00:02:11.267
whose relationship
with DJ Cello,

00:02:11.267 --> 00:02:13.400
played by
the amazing Kid Cudi --

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.767
The news about
their relationship fluctuating

00:02:15.767 --> 00:02:18.167
sort of eclipses the news

00:02:18.167 --> 00:02:21.067
of the Earth coming to an end,
which is great.

00:02:21.067 --> 00:02:23.367
-Fantastic. "Don't Look Up"
is in select theaters

00:02:23.367 --> 00:02:26.667
December 10th
and on Netflix December 24th.

00:02:26.667 --> 00:02:28.167
Congrats on that.

00:02:28.167 --> 00:02:31.300
Are we going to see more acting
of Ariana in the future?

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:33.801
-I would love that.
I hope so, yeah.

00:02:33.801 --> 00:02:35.901
-I was just talking
to a friend of mine

00:02:35.901 --> 00:02:38.200
who said that he saw you
on Broadway in like --

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:40.834
Was it "13"? Is that the name
of a show that you were in?

00:02:40.834 --> 00:02:42.367
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Yes, oh, my God!

00:02:42.367 --> 00:02:45.067
Who is this friend?
Thanks for coming.

00:02:45.067 --> 00:02:47.133
-No, he said,
even watching you --

00:02:47.133 --> 00:02:49.234
You were probably 13
when you were doing it.

00:02:49.234 --> 00:02:50.334
He goes, you could tell

00:02:50.334 --> 00:02:51.634
that you were going to be
a superstar.

00:02:51.634 --> 00:02:53.334
They were like,
"That kid's got it."

00:02:53.334 --> 00:02:56.367
-Oh, my God! What?
Thank you. That's so nice.

00:02:56.367 --> 00:02:58.601
-Yeah.
-I feel like you made this up.

00:02:58.601 --> 00:03:00.868
Thank you, though.
-Actually, I really didn't.

00:03:00.868 --> 00:03:02.601
I swear. Yeah.
I didn't see it.

00:03:02.601 --> 00:03:04.968
My friend saw it. Yeah.
-Oh, Okay.

00:03:04.968 --> 00:03:07.367
-But I will say -- I don't
even know what we can say,

00:03:07.367 --> 00:03:10.067
but we have a special
little fun thing

00:03:10.067 --> 00:03:12.868
for everyone that's a secret
that's going to come out soon.

00:03:12.868 --> 00:03:15.567
-Oh, my God, yes. I'm so excited
about this secret.

00:03:15.567 --> 00:03:17.701
Is it your skin-care routine?

00:03:17.701 --> 00:03:19.567
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.567 --> 00:03:21.667
-No, that's a different thing,
my skin-care routine.

00:03:21.667 --> 00:03:23.200
But --
-Oh.

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:25.267
Would you like to walk them
through that or no?

00:03:25.267 --> 00:03:26.534
-No, I don't, because that was

00:03:26.534 --> 00:03:28.067
the most embarrassing
thing ever.

00:03:28.067 --> 00:03:30.133
-It was the best moment
of my life.

00:03:30.133 --> 00:03:31.400
It was so much fun. Sorry.

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:32.701
Go ahead. We don't have to
tell them. It's fine.

00:03:32.701 --> 00:03:35.834
-Okay. Yeah, okay.
I didn't want to talk about it.

00:03:35.834 --> 00:03:40.067
But we can show two
little things of this secret,

00:03:40.067 --> 00:03:41.968
and it's --

00:03:41.968 --> 00:03:44.100
It just wants to bring
a little joy to people

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:45.801
and a smile to people
during the holidays.

00:03:45.801 --> 00:03:49.000
But this is one picture
that you took on set, a selfie.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:52.601
You can see kind of
where we're kind of going.

00:03:52.601 --> 00:03:56.334
We never quite used --
Do you still have your bag?

00:03:56.334 --> 00:03:57.501
-I sure do.

00:03:57.501 --> 00:03:59.067
-I love you, bud,
I have mine, too.

00:03:59.067 --> 00:04:00.767
I have mine, too.
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:04:00.767 --> 00:04:02.767
I'm going to do that
right after this interv--

00:04:02.767 --> 00:04:04.667
Oh, come on. I love you.

00:04:04.667 --> 00:04:06.968
-These were --
These were full of wine on set.

00:04:06.968 --> 00:04:08.934
I wanted to point that out.
-They were.

00:04:08.934 --> 00:04:11.133
They're not --
Mine's not full anymore.

00:04:11.133 --> 00:04:12.501
-Mine either.
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:12.501 --> 00:04:15.067
But we can --
Honestly, we can show

00:04:15.067 --> 00:04:18.334
a little bit of video footage
from what we did.

00:04:18.334 --> 00:04:19.767
Again, we can't say what it is,

00:04:19.767 --> 00:04:21.667
but maybe you can figure it out
if you just watch this.

00:04:21.667 --> 00:04:23.100
-It's top-secret,
but check it out.

00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:24.501
-Yeah.

00:04:24.501 --> 00:04:25.968
Okay, there you go.

00:04:25.968 --> 00:04:27.901
-That might give it away.
-That's all I can say.

00:04:27.901 --> 00:04:29.467
That's it.
That's all we can do.

00:04:29.467 --> 00:04:30.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:30.701 --> 00:04:33.634
-They definitely --
I think that was too much.

00:04:33.634 --> 00:04:35.267
They're definitely
going to know how.

00:04:35.267 --> 00:04:37.601
-Yeah. Now they're gonna know.
Everyone knows what it is.

00:04:37.601 --> 00:04:39.133
But anyway,
you'll see really soon,

00:04:39.133 --> 00:04:41.000
